mlxflow 0.8; events; network
1. On Schedule           every=day; at=06:30; max_runs=2/day
2. Read Text             topics.txt   # one query per line
3. Split                 by=lines
4. <each one_topic; on_error=skip>   [text] -> [text]
     1. Web Search   (input:1)   top_k=3; recency=day
     2. <each fetch_one; on_error=skip ; [url] -> [text]>
          1. Web Fetch   (input:1)   as=markdown
     3. Summarize                Ministral 3B; "2 lines: what's new"
5. Join Text             separator="\n\n"
6. Rewrite               Qwen3 8B; "One briefing: merge overlaps, lead
                         with the most consequential item"
7. Template      (6,1)   "# Briefing — {2}\n\n{1}"
8. Save Text             briefings/briefing.md
